        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good morning, Elaine. Adrian Lim here, calling for our arranged telephone review. Are you somewhere comfortable to talk, or would you prefer that I call back later?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Morning, Adrian. Now is good. I'm in my study with the door closed. Telephone appointments are easier for me than going down to the branch."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Certainly, we can keep these reviews by telephone. It saves you having to fit a trip into the working day. How has your schedule been lately?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Still quite full, but I'm trying to make it quieter. My team can handle the routine meetings now, so I don't need to be everywhere."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "That sounds like a useful change. Do you manage to keep a little time in the week away from work calls?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I'm starting to. I keep an afternoon free for myself, though sometimes someone still rings. Having appointments arranged beforehand helps me protect that time."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "We'll keep that preference on file. Before we get into the review, I need to complete the identity check. Please provide your FIN and date of birth."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_012]] [[EV_013]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you, the identity check is complete. I'll keep the conversation straightforward, as you prefer. [[EV_001]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I've got my notes beside me, so there's no need to rush through the call. [[EV_014]] [[EV_018]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_002]] [[EV_003]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_004]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
